{"id":"W151b625315f11607d69a9a48","zh":"","en":"Wheel–rail lateral relative displacement","name":"Wheel–rail lateral relative displacement","language":"en","domain":"文献术语","concept_id":null,"families":[],"definition_zh":null,"definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"W151b625315f11607d69a9a48","text":"Wheel–rail lateral relative displacement","language":"en","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"S0d69988fbe59bdad919f","source_id":"P016","page":22,"page_end":22,"language":"en","text":"The limit of the wheel–rail lateral relative displacement is 9.1 mm.","citations":[{"source_id":"P016","page":22,"page_end":22}]},{"id":"Sef6b005bf7d4345e70d0","source_id":"P016","page":23,"page_end":23,"language":"en","text":"It is indicated that the failure probability of wheel–rail lateral relative displacement is over 20%, which means that the flange of the wheels will frequently hit the side profile of the rail, and consequently, side wear of the rails and the wheel flanges will develop at a rapid rate on curves.","citations":[{"source_id":"P016","page":23,"page_end":23}]}],"sources":{"P016":{"id":"P016","title":"Probabilistic assessment of railway vehicle-curved track systems considering track random irregularities","authors":"L Xu, W Zhai","year":"2018","doi":"10.1080/00423114.2018.1424916","journal_citation":"Vehicle System Dynamics 56 (10), 1552-1576","label":"Xu等（2018）","overview_slug":"2018-probabilistic-assessment-of-railway-vehicle-curved-track-systems-considering-track-random-irregulari"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[{"text":"衡量轮轨横向位置关系，以9.1 mm限值评估侧向接触风险。","language":"zh","source_id":"P016","paper_slug":"2018-probabilistic-assessment-of-railway-vehicle-curved-track-systems-considering-track-random-irregulari","title":"考虑轨道随机不平顺的铁路车辆—曲线轨道系